<http://data.silknow.org/object/f58c5f52-b9a1-399e-9f20-149519087f07/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Fragment of a cover of plain weave cotton embroidered with silk in surface darning on the diagonal and running stitch.\n\nEmbroidery threads: 2S silk; black, white, dark green, green, light blue, yellow, red, blue, light brown.\n\nIncomplete pattern of lozenges and diamonds and stars.  There is a yellow star with a small blue diamond centre. To the right of this is the upper part of a diamond sub-divided into smaller diamonds in red, yellow, dark green and white."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/f58c5f52-b9a1-399e-9f20-149519087f07> .

<http://data.silknow.org/object/f58c5f52-b9a1-399e-9f20-149519087f07>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Fragment of a cover of plain weave cotton embroidered with silk in surface darning on the diagonal and running stitch.\n\nEmbroidery threads: 2S silk; black, white, dark green, green, light blue, yellow, red, blue, light brown.\n\nIncomplete pattern of lozenges and diamonds and stars.  There is a yellow star with a small blue diamond centre. To the right of this is the upper part of a diamond sub-divided into smaller diamonds in red, yellow, dark green and white."@en , "Middle East, Textile; Fragment of a cover of embroidered cotton with silk thread, Azerbaijan, 1770-1799"@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/01ecc123-7b49-3634-ad6c-e6bfc99d9564> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/6ac86121-0e65-3b98-b5ab-1d231e46fd15> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Middle East, Textile; Fragment of a cover of embroidered cotton with silk thread, Azerbaijan, 1770-1799"@en , "Fragment of a cover of plain weave cotton embroidered with silk in surface darning on the diagonal and running stitch.\n\nEmbroidery threads: 2S silk; black, white, dark green, green, light blue, yellow, red, blue, light brown.\n\nIncomplete pattern of lozenges and diamonds and stars.  There is a yellow star with a small blue diamond centre. To the right of this is the upper part of a diamond sub-divided into smaller diamonds in red, yellow, dark green and white."@en ;
